prefs.note=Appearance and language changes take effect immediately. Windows high contrast overrides the selected theme. Translations: lang/pl.lng and lang/en.lng. Preferences: Radeoner.settings.json next to the EXE. Startup applies to the current user and opens the tray without applying a GPU profile. After moving the folder, turn startup off and on again. Alt+F4 hides to tray; Exit closes the app.
