update.current=Installed version: {0}
update.note=Updates come from public proszczok2002/Radeoner releases on GitHub. Checking never installs automatically. Download and install closes the app and starts the new version. Profiles and preferences are preserved. The old EXE is only deleted after the new version starts successfully. Drivers and GPU tuning settings are not changed.
